    Bug 2063661 - Restore the natural height resizing of the About dialog based on its content. r=tobyp

    Simplified more the CSS and followed what Firefox is doing with their dialog.
    Unfortunately we can't achieve the same result of having the content growing vertically when resized.
    This is due to the Firefox dialog still being a XUL window, while we transition to an HTML dialog in Thunderbird.
    When resizing the dialog, the `html` container will not grow, but that's an issue we can ignore
    since the dialog resizing on Linux is a toolkit problem and it shouldn't happen.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319301

